      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T18:25:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This returns the device-space sigma, but I think we should be passing in the local-space sigma, which is what\u0027s calculated in the `asImageFilter()` function. It probably makes sense to have `computeXformedSigma` stay as the device-space sigma and add a `getLocalSigma(ctm)` function that can be called here and inside `asImageFilter()`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2312,
        "startChar": 55,
        "endLine": 2312,
        "endChar": 74
      },
      "revId": "3267b25ef32fc627aa431d8cc0d36b8e6e1d209d",
